logize, but I encountered an issue while trying to send the email. It seems the service is receiving too many requests. Please try again in a moment.\\nHuman: Hi can you send mail to sasan@csevents.ae for get appointment  to tommorow interview\\nAI: Subject: Interview Appointment Request\\n\\nRecipient: sasan@csevents.ae\\n\\nPlain-text Preview:\\nDear Sasan,\\n\\nI am writing to request an appointment for an interview tomorrow. Please let me know your availability.\\n\\n~DS Automation~\\n\\nPlease review the above email. Type 'accept mail' to send, or reply with changes.\\nHuman: Include  more details\"],\"options\":{\"google_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"GOOGLE_API_KEY\"]},\"base_url\":\"https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"What additional details would you like to include in the email regarding the interview appointment? For example, do you want to specify a preferred time, the position you are interviewing for, or any other relevant information?\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finishReason\":\"STOP\",\"index\":0}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":41,\"promptTokens\":1458,\"totalTokens\":1499}}}"}}
